==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|diversite}}, from {{der|en|fro|diversité}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|dīversitās}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/daɪˈvɜː(ɹ)sɪti/|/dɪˈvɜː(ɹ)sɪti/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-uk-diversity.ogg|Audio (UK)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|diversities}}

# The quality of being [[diverse]] or [[different]]; [[difference]] or [[unlikeness]].
# A [[variety]]; [[diverse]] types or examples.
